<title>UK: Land Secs says Henderson to succeed Hunt.</title>
<headline>Land Secs says Henderson to succeed Hunt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property company Land Securities Plc said on Wednesday that Ian Henderson would succeed Sir Peter Hunt as group managing director when the latter reaches his 65th birthday on July 1, 1998.</p>
<p>Hunt would remain chairman, however, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Henderson has been deputy managing director since last year and has been managing director of Land Securities Properties since 1990.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5642 8864.</p>
